 "statements": [
  {
   "sid": "s1",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://broadbandbreakfast.com/ces2026-carr-outlines-fcc-spectrum-ai-and-broadcast-priorities/",
   "text": "You can’t ask a startup to hire 50 lawyers just to deploy a product,",
   "source_type": "reported_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Brendan Carr",
    "organization_id": "fcc",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s2",
   "date": "2024-08-07",
   "url": "https://docs.fcc.gov/public/attachments/FCC-24-84A3.txt",
   "text": "I don’t believe in “no regulation” of AI but at the same time believe there is a risk of overdoing it early on.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Brendan Carr",
    "organization_id": "fcc",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s3",
   "date": "2024-08-07",
   "url": "https://docs.fcc.gov/public/attachments/FCC-24-84A3.txt",
   "text": "One, I don't think we should be regulating AI based purely on speculative harms that aren’t showing up in the real world.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Brendan Carr",
    "organization_id": "fcc",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s4",
   "date": "2024-08-07",
   "url": "https://docs.fcc.gov/public/attachments/FCC-24-84A3.txt",
   "text": "Third, we need to make sure we continue to support US innovation and leadership.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Brendan Carr",
    "organization_id": "fcc",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s5",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://docs.fcc.gov/public/attachments/FCC-24-74A3.txt",
   "text": "The FCC’s attempt to fundamentally alter the regulation of political speech just a short time before a national election is as misguided as it is unlawful.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Brendan Carr",
    "organization_id": "fcc",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
